  <!-- EN: There is no room for the shuttle to land, so the {0} support troops are evacuating by drop pod. -->
  <Weazel_XCCEvacPod>穿梭机没有降落空间，{0}的支援部队改以空投舱撤离。</Weazel_XCCEvacPod>
