  <!-- EN: Overcharge -->
  <Weazel_EnergyBladeToggle>超载</Weazel_EnergyBladeToggle>
  <!-- EN: Raise the output and switch the attack to a sweep. A sweep hits every target in a 3-cell cone in the attack direction, allies included, but attacks more slowly.\n\nTurn it off to return to the downward slash, which deals heavy damage to a single target. After switching, you can't switch again for 10 seconds. -->
  <Weazel_EnergyBladeToggleDesc>提高输出功率，将攻击切换为横扫。横扫会击中攻击方向3格锥形范围内的所有目标（包括友军），但攻击速度较慢。\n\n关闭后会恢复为对单一目标造成重创的下劈。切换后10秒内无法再次切换。</Weazel_EnergyBladeToggleDesc>
  <!-- EN: Output switch on cooldown ({0}s) -->
  <Weazel_EnergyBladeToggleCooldown>输出切换冷却中（{0}秒）</Weazel_EnergyBladeToggleCooldown>
  <!-- EN: Attack mode: downward slash -->
  <Weazel_EnergyBladeModeSlash>攻击模式：下劈</Weazel_EnergyBladeModeSlash>
