  <!-- EN: Choose this bed's original owner from the people assigned to it. The original owner's name tag is shown in gold. -->
  <Weazel_221Bed_SetOriginalOwnerDesc>从分配到这张床的人之中选出床的原主人。原主人的名牌会以金色显示。</Weazel_221Bed_SetOriginalOwnerDesc>
